      <h3 id="bankrewards-title"><a href="https://bankrewards.io">bankrewards.io ↗</a></h3>
      <p>A bank, credit-card, and brokerage bonus comparison platform, built end to end.</p>
      <p>The SvelteKit site runs on Cloudflare Workers and D1, with Payload CMS and an automated offer pipeline. An LLM-agent stage continuously re-verifies offers against banks’ live pages. All on a $5/month Cloudflare subscription.</p>
      <p class="why">Most people have no idea how many bank bonuses are out there. I wanted to make them easy to find.</p>
      <div class="stack">
        <span>TypeScript</span><span>SvelteKit</span><span>Cloudflare Workers / D1</span><span>Payload CMS</span><span>Playwright</span><span>PostHog</span>
      </div>
    </div>
